    "description": "The Telecom SIM Swap API facilitates the replacement of a customer's SIM card within the telecom service. This operation is critical for customers who have lost their SIM, need to upgrade, or change to a different device. By utilizing this API, businesses can streamline the process for end-users, enabling them to initiate a SIM swap request efficiently. Typical consumers of this API include telecom service providers and customer support systems that require seamless management of SIM-related operations.",
